<p>(Slovenia)/Noelle Van Lottum (France) 4-6 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Ines Gorrochategui (Argentina)/Linda Wild (U.S.) beat Silke</p>
<p>Meier (Germany)/Petra Schwarz (Austria) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>8-Alexandra Fusai/Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Sung-Hee Park</p>
<p>(South Korea)/Shi-Ting Wang (Taiwan) 6-3 6-4</p>
